/* ONE competency a page, its levels side by side (Chris, 2026-10-21, canvas LNPTK3eL11qMtAJDFmitjt option A): a white
   card per level on the grey ground, its description, three abilities and the fold, and its buttons along the foot
   under a hairline, so the pair's buttons sit level. A competency with one level takes the row. The person's own card
