   filter; colmenu.js's look, .col-menu / .col-menu-btn), the name alone in its column and the department in its own
   (Chris, 2026-10-07). Fixed widths so Moved stays narrow and the actions keep their room off the right edge. */
.rv-tbox-listwrap { flex: 1 1 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
.rv-tbox-lbar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; min-height: 20px; }
.rv-tbox-lcount { font-size: 0.78125rem; color: var(--d-fg-5b6178); }
.rv-tbox-lclear { font-size: 0.78125rem; }
.rv-tbox-lscroll { flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 0; overflow: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px;
  overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-gutter: stable; }
.rv-tbox-body:not(.is-fixed) .rv-tbox-lscroll { max-height: 520px; }
.rv-tbox-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; font-size: 0.8125rem; }
