/* a BG CEO's record: business units first, each opening its Talent Box (board I) */
/* the Talent Box and the business units: two cards, the units' foot (See your people, or what is released to a BU
   CEO) on the same line as the box's four talent status totals (2026-10-13) */
.od-boxg, .od-boxu { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
.od-box-g { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; }
