/* The inactivity box, 2026-11-02 (canvas [design canvas link removed], boards 1-2; static/session_alive.js):
   the app's confirm dialog (.modal-overlay.confirm-dialog > .modal-card, 460px) with a countdown panel under the message.
   It sits above any other dialog: nothing else matters once the hour is running out. */
.idle-dialog { z-index: 1100; }
