/* ---- Filters per viewer (Chris, 2026-11-02, canvas "OneHR Calibration Filters by Viewer", "Yes, as drawn"): the Filters card's tabs
   (BU CEO & Talent Box, Calibrators, Group Chiefs, Executive Chairman), the tables and the 560px panels of the last three. ---- */
.adm-set-chip { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-ink); background: var(--d-bg-eef1fa); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; white-space: nowrap; }
.vf-lede { margin: 0 0 4px; }
.vf-sub { margin: 0 0 8px; }
.vf-tabs { display: flex; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); margin: 8px 0 12px; }
/* four tabs do not fit a settings card's width at the larger text sizes: they share the row and a long one wraps to two lines (its small
   words under its name) rather than a second row of tabs */
.vf-tab { flex: 0 1 auto; min-width: 0; padding: 10px 12px; margin-bottom: -1px; font-size: 0.84375rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; }
.vf-tab:hover { color: var(--accent-ink); background: var(--surface-2); text-decoration: none; }
