/* Grade H's two on-screen reports (2026-11-04, canvas 3DAZsbGDB5Hik7vqWgF72M boards R4, R5): eight number columns, or four bars, in the card at
   1280. The row label may be narrower (it wraps, its words are the cell's own) and a bar may be narrower (each segment's numbers are in its title);
   headings stay on one line. At the larger text sizes the table scrolls inside its card, as the other on-screen reports do. */
.rptv-gh tbody th, .rptv-gh tfoot th, .rptv-gh thead th:first-child { min-width: 9rem; }
