/* ---- Career Plan Overview, split (Chris 2026-11-06, canvas PAzm9HkvkUTBsFGntZqKwd): the people in the review, then the people who write a plan
   outside it. Tokens and rem only; the tiles, cards and tables are the page's existing classes. ---- */
.ipo-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 12px; margin: 22px 0 10px; }
