/* ---- Person page > Career Plan: roles suggested for one person (Chris, 2026-11-07, canvas Nb3NYF8C9W5X3F3Pcr6drX boards A1
   and A2; templates/person/_suggest_roles.html, super admin only; the picker is static/admin.js "Roles suggested for one
   person"). Tokens and rem only; the picker reuses the house .pick, .pick-q and .pick-list, set in the flow here so the
   Cancel and Suggest row sits under it. ---- */
.sg { margin-top: 0.75rem; padding-top: 0.75rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
.sg-hd { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; }
