/* Email > Schedule: "Emails to leaders" (Chris, 2026-11-08, canvas EzdKUkKZXSSu39J4H3BY9y option A as drawn). Headings on the two
   cards above the list, the leaders card's three rows on a four-column grid, Set it up as a real button on both cards. */
.eml-hd { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 0 10px; }
