/* Email > Schedule's top card, "On their own schedule" (Chris, 2026-11-09, canvas A1): a row an email on a three-column grid, its switch
   and name, its next send (bold) with one muted line, Set it up (and Send now). An off row's words go quiet. */
.eml-own-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(13rem, 15rem) minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 6px 20px; align-items: center; padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft); }
