.adm-panel-foot .lmt-send:disabled { opacity: .45; cursor: not-allowed; }

/* ===== LEADER REVIEWS: the status box over a leader's people, and the list panel's joined search field (Chris, 2026-11-09) =======
   Canvas "Leader reviews on the person page" (boards A1-A5, B1, C1, S). The box: the review's title, its state pill and the one
   line, with the action that fits on the right; 18px between the text column and the buttons, 8px between a pill and its words. */
.lr-box { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 8px 18px; align-items: center; margin: 0 0 14px; padding: 12px 16px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--surface); }
