   OneHR/Phone view C build brief 2026-11-07.md. The same rule as pieces A and B: under 1024px the phone view, 1024px and up the desktop,
   untouched, so every rule below sits inside THIS one query and no desktop rule is edited. The widgets draw their phone parts into the same
   markup (each carrying the hidden attribute, which the rules below turn on) or, for a sheet that opens on a tap, draw it for a phone when it
   opens; they post through the same writers (calMove, calLockForm, tbPostMove, tbLockForm, tbSelectCompany). The page works out no band,
